Z||000004||lowCG||06-27-2000||10:30 AM||||Chrysler uses a longitudinal tranny,with solenoid shifting like a tiptronic,you could have shift buttons on your steering wheel.<BR>I think you'd need to lengthen the wheelbase to make some room however.<BR>The end of the tranny looks pretty cool hanging out of the rear valence,polished.||||reg||1
